# DT OG++ - what must never be committed.
#
# You supply the stock firmware and your own manual locally; the tool is built
# locally; builds and analysis are produced locally. None of it is ever
# distributed. Elektron firmware and manual text in particular can never be
# redistributed, so their whole directories are ignored, plus the file kinds
# themselves in case one is dropped elsewhere in the tree.
# (Git has no inline comments: every comment below is on its own line.)

# --- user-supplied and generated directories -------------------------------
# your own stock Digitakt_OS1.52A.syx goes here
sysex/
# your own manual PDF goes here
manuals/
# the firmware tool is cloned and built into tool/ locally
tool/
# built firmware output
out/
# analysis and intermediate files
work/
# Python bytecode (build/make_listing.py imports build/build.py)
__pycache__/
# your own, personal agent memory file (CLAUDE.md imports it if it exists)
/MEMORY.md

# --- firmware / section / build artefacts (by kind) ------------------------
*.syx
*.SYX
*.bin
section_*
*.raw

# --- manuals (by kind) -----------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.PDF

# --- Ghidra project files --------------------------------------------------
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.gbf
*.prp

# --- agent-harness and private-memory litter -------------------------------
.claude/
.shared_memory

# --- logs ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- macOS litter ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
__MACOSX
